      "description": "The poster at the top of a shared bill: title and total in the sky, date line beneath, breaking up into the page in squares.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-scene\"><h1 class=\"ds-scene-title\">Naklaa Mookata</h1><span class=\"ds-scene-total\">฿2,848.34</span><p class=\"ds-scene-sub\">31 Oct 2026 · 4 people · split by item</p></header>",
      "css": ".ds-scene{position:relative;min-height:250px;padding:28px 20px 44px;background:var(--scene) center 74%/cover no-repeat,var(--scene-sky);color:var(--on-scene);}.ds-scene::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;height:20px;background:repeating-conic-gradient(var(--bg) 0 25%,transparent 0 50%) 0 0/20px 20px;}.ds-scene-title{font-family:var(--font-anybody),var(--font-kanit),'Arial Black',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:900;margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.015em;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgb(0 0 0 / .25);}.ds-scene-total{font-family:var(--font-anybody),var(--font-kanit),'Arial Black',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:900;display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:40px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-shadow:0 2px 14px rgb(0 0 0 / .3);}.ds-scene-sub{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--on-scene-2);font:600 15px system-ui,sans-serif;text-shadow:0 1px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / .35);}"
    }
